      "heading": {
        "zh": "短输入容量、长输出与自然请求呈现不同服务曲线",
        "en": "Short-input capacity, long output, and natural requests produce different serving curves"
      },
      "intro": {
        "zh": "8×MI308X、TP4、vLLM ROCm nightly；主表关闭投机解码。固定长度矩阵分别为 128/128 C1、128/2048 C16、512/256 C32；ShareGPT 与 BFCL Agent 是独立工作负载。",
        "en": "Eight MI308X accelerators, TP4, vLLM ROCm nightly; speculative decoding is off for the primary matrix. Fixed profiles are 128/128 C1, 128/2048 C16, and 512/256 C32. ShareGPT and BFCL Agent are separate workloads."
      },
      "notes": [
